sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client App (Python / TypeScript)
    participant Cache as KV-Cache / Prompt Cache Layer
    participant API as Anthropic Messages API (Claude 5.5 / 5.x)
    participant Engine as Inference Engine (Reasoning & Strict CFG)

    Note over Client,API: 1. Request Dispatch (No temperature/top_p allowed on 4.7+/5.x)
    Client->>API: POST /v1/messages<br/>{model: "claude-sonnet-5-5",<br/> system: [{type: "text", text: "...", cache_control: {type: "ephemeral"}}],<br/> messages: [...],<br/> output_config: {effort: "medium", format: {type: "json_schema", schema: ...}},<br/> tools: [{name: "...", strict: true, input_schema: ...}]}

    Note over API,Cache: 2. Exact Prefix Cache Evaluation
    API->>Cache: Lookup Prefix Hash (System + Document Blocks + History)
    alt Cache Hit (90%–95% Discount)
        Cache-->>API: Pre-computed K,V Activation Tensors (Fast-path)
    else Cache Miss / Cold Write
        API->>Cache: Compute Prefill & Write KV Tensors (1.25x surcharge)
    end

    Note over API,Engine: 3. Dynamic Reasoning & Constrained Generation
    API->>Engine: Evaluate Output Config (Effort Level: low|medium|high|xhigh|max)
    Engine->>Engine: Generate Extended Thinking Tokens (Hidden/Visible CoT)
    Engine->>Engine: Compute Cryptographic Signature for Thinking Block
    Engine->>Engine: Constrained Decoding (CFG Grammar Masking or Strict Tool Schema)

    Note over API,Client: 4. SSE Streaming Delivery Protocol
    API-->>Client: event: message_start {message: {id: "msg_...", model: "claude-sonnet-5-5", role: "assistant"}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_start {index: 0, content_block: {type: "thinking", thinking: ""}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_delta {index: 0, delta: {type: "thinking_delta", thinking: "Analyzing constraints..."}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_delta {index: 0, delta: {type: "signature_delta", signature: "c2ln..."}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_stop {index: 0}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_start {index: 1, content_block: {type: "text", text: ""}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_delta {index: 1, delta: {type: "text_delta", text: "{\"status\": \"approved\"}", citations: [...]}}
    API-->>Client: event: content_block_stop {index: 1}
    API-->>Client: event: message_delta {delta: {stop_reason: "end_turn"}, usage: {output_tokens: 384}}
    API-->>Client: event: message_stop

    Note over Client: 5. Client Unpacking & Multi-Turn Preservation
    Client->>Client: Parse Structured Output -> response.parsed_output
    Client->>Client: Extract Document Citations (char_location / page_location, 0 billable output tokens)
    Client->>Client: Preserve thinking block byte-for-byte in conversation history for turn N+1
